    "highlights": "The design system includes a \".shimmer-text\" highlighting effect, achieved using a linear-gradient background (with transparent text fill via background-clip) and animated horizontally to create a dynamic shimmering effect on the text.",
    "insights": [
      "The typography system creates a distinct editorial but technical brand feel by pairing the custom serif \"Waldenburg\" for large display headings with the highly readable sans-serif \"Inter\" for body and UI elements.",
      "A very robust modular scale is used through CSS custom properties (e.g., var(--tw-font-size-6xl)), allowing responsive scaling of typography while maintaining strict adherence to the design system across breakpoints.",
      "\"Geist Mono\" is exclusively utilized for code snippets, imports, and technical terms, reinforcing a developer-centric product identity."
